Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.49,1:41:08.91,EDTL,,0,0,0,,In the countless "somedays" ahead, I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.04,1:41:13.00,EDTL,,0,0,0,,When will my wish come true?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.12,1:41:18.30,EDTL,,0,0,0,,Or, will that time never come?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.01,1:41:23.26,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I keep thinking that I need to move forward,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.38,1:41:27.31,EDTL,,0,0,0,,but I just can't take that first step,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.43,1:41:31.81,EDTL,,0,0,0,,and I end up making excuses for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.31,1:41:36.86,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I can't turn time back even one second,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.98,1:41:39.53,EDTL,,0,0,0,,and I can't see into the next second.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.65,1:41:47.95,EDTL,,0,0,0,,So, when I realize this, I'll put my heart's trust in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.66,1:41:54.75,EDTL,,0,0,0,,Like the wind that blows across the seven seas,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.75,1:41:58.17,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I'm painting a dream of our future in blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.17,1:42:00.80,EDTL,,0,0,0,,When my heart is almost crushed,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.80,1:42:01.76,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I turn around, and
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.76,1:42:04.22,EDTL,,0,0,0,,you're always there.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.22,1:42:08.51,EDTL,,0,0,0,,You're always passionately there.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.14,1:42:13.43,EDTL,,0,0,0,,Many shining miracles stir the waves.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.56,1:42:17.48,EDTL,,0,0,0,,This world is overflowing with them...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.61,1:42:22.82,EDTL,,0,0,0,,such as the orange that melts into the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.40,1:42:31.79,EDTL,,0,0,0,,But, eventhough the line between fantasy and reality was broken,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.91,1:42:36.29,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I still won't give up next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.75,1:42:40.25,EDTL,,0,0,0,,Looking for sunlight,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.38,1:42:43.84,EDTL,,0,0,0,,and growing like a flower bud
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.97,1:42:52.27,EDTL,,0,0,0,,that was shined on by your radiant smile, I grew stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.27,1:42:59.23,EDTL,,0,0,0,,Like the wind that blows across the seven seas,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.23,1:43:02.48,EDTL,,0,0,0,,the red flowers will bloom again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.48,1:43:04.44,EDTL,,0,0,0,,Even when the oasis in my heart
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.44,1:43:07.16,EDTL,,0,0,0,,and my breath has almost dried up,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.16,1:43:12.66,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,500)}I want to continue to feel your strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.34,1:43:32.31,EDTL,,0,0,0,,Even though this world revolves around sadness,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.43,1:43:35.06,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I'll live in it because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.06,1:43:40.81,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I'll spread my wings and soar.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.61,1:43:47.57,EDTL,,0,0,0,,Like the wind that blows across the seven seas,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.57,1:43:50.99,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I'm painting a dream of our future in blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.99,1:43:53.62,EDTL,,0,0,0,,When my heart is almost crushed,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.62,1:43:54.58,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I turn around, and
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.58,1:43:57.04,EDTL,,0,0,0,,you're always there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.04,1:43:58.83,EDTL,,0,0,0,,You're always passionately there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.83,1:44:02.46,EDTL,,0,0,0,,I want to continue to feel your strength,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.46,1:44:08.84,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,500)}like the wind that blows across the seven seas.
